// Hull parts: armor blocks and slopes. PLACEHOLDER NUMBERS (concept-board drydock values, for feel only).
// Hull parts take an armor material per placement; mass and hit points come from the material.
// Slopes are right triangles over a w × 1 footprint: unrotated, the right angle sits bottom-left and the face
// points up and to the right. They connect only through their two straight sides.
